  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to high heat, approximately 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, salt, black pepper, paprika, and sumac.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat evenly with the marinade.",
    "Thread the chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the chicken for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Let the chicken rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
